WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.225
Fourier restriction in three dimensions.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.637
Waves off a curved surface. The human record

3
00:00:05.637 --> 00:00:08.119
was twenty-two sevenths; the conjecture says three.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.293
Track how packets bunch up; that capacity spreads along lines.

5
00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:17.457
Claimed: every exponent above three, for curved surfaces.

6
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.050
No Lean proof.
